[[Open This|Preferred Qualifications]]

---

    Proficiency in using and troubleshooting Git, GitHub or similar version control systems, with a strong understanding of software development workflows and tools, such as CI/CD pipelines,code security, issue tracking systems, code editors/IDEs(e.g., VS Code, IntelliJ IDEA)

    Experience performing Linux system administration and working experience with common tools like Docker, systemd, openssl, etc

    Familiarity with production-level virtualization platforms and/or cloud providers (e.g., VMware ESX, KVM, AWS, Azure)

    Experience in customer-service oriented environment, with strong teamwork, collaboration, adaptability, and initiative. Experience providing technical support to enterprise customers is required, along with exceptional verbal, written, organizational, presentation, and communication skills.